{"id":"417460","name":"番茄南瓜薏米羹","author":"緣豆兒","authorId":"8471333","desc":"","cover":"images/417460/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"薏米","amount":"50克"},{"name":"番茄","amount":"2个"},{"name":"南瓜","amount":"400克"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好材料。","img":"images/417460/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"薏米洗净提前浸泡1~2小时。","img":"images/417460/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"南瓜去皮去籽块。","img":"images/417460/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"番茄切块。","img":"images/417460/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"鸡蛋打散备用。","img":"images/417460/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅中加水1200ml，加入薏米先煮15分钟。","img":"images/417460/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入南瓜和番茄继续煮15分钟。","img":"images/417460/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入蛋液搅拌成蛋花。","img":"images/417460/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"最后加盐调味就可以喝了。","img":"images/417460/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：汤锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}